OL,3,GNEWSALondon's Oxford Street becoming
OL,4,Apedestrian-only marks end of decline,
OL,5,Asays Khan
OL,6,
OL,7,FCars, buses, taxis and bicycles can no
OL,8,Flonger travel along much of Oxford
OL,9,FStreet with almost a kilometre of the
OL,10,Froad now pedestrianised
OL,12,FThe famous London shopping street has
OL,13,Fbeen made traffic free between Orchard
OL,14,FStreet and Great Portland Street
OL,16,FVehicles will still be able to flow
OL,17,Fnorth and south across the street at
OL,18,Fcertain points, while buses are being
OL,19,Fdiverted on to other roads
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
