OL,3,GNEWSALondon's Oxford Street becoming
OL,4,Apedestrian-only marks end of decline,
OL,5,Asays Khan
OL,6,
OL,7,FLondon Mayor Lord Khan says the move
OL,8,Fmarks the "end of decline" for the
OL,9,Fstreet, but others worry about how it
OL,10,Fwill affect surrounding neighbourhoods
OL,12,FThe traffic may have been stopped but
OL,13,Fthe initial works scheme is not
OL,14,Fexpected to be completed until spring
OL,15,Fnext year. Find out more about the
OL,16,Fchanges here
